/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (Water resource management for agriculture is a critical challenge in Thailand. Many farmers still lack accessible data and decision-support tools to allocate water efficiently according to crop type and season. Meanwhile, faculty members in the Faculty of Agriculture already hold valuable scenario-based datasets, but no digital tool exists to organize and deliver this knowledge easily. This project develops a web application that recommends water management practices, supporting teaching and technology transfer to farmers.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
